2026-11-27T10:34:25.5306778Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5307007Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5307268Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5307533Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5307961Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
