2026-11-27T10:34:25.5308505Z 
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5308611Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5309049Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5309410Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5309740Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
