2026-11-27T10:34:25.5310758Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5311052Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5311314Z   ok   the override is flagged active
