2026-11-27T10:34:25.5313460Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5313841Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5314426Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5314672Z 
