2026-11-27T10:34:25.5315302Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5315698Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5316121Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5316685Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5317051Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5317237Z 
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5317418Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5317805Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5318164Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5318457Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5318756Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5318926Z 
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5319075Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5319399Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5319669Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5319910Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
