2026-11-27T10:34:25.5320557Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5320821Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5321085Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5321420Z   ok   a non-finite or over-nameplate power reading is no measurement
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5321759Z   ok   a power reading at the nameplate is a measurement
