2026-11-27T10:34:25.5322798Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5323068Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5323380Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5323774Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5324345Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5324872Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5325247Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5325610Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5325952Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5326330Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5326705Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-11-27T10:34:25.5327043Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
